&lt;li&gt;Deliver your first board data package with minimal hand-holding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce an initial labeling services P&amp;amp;L with project-level margin visibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Audit external accounting and payroll vendors; present a recommendation on any changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First 90 Days&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full board prep process end-to-end, including the deck, data, and follow-ups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ship a company-wide KPI framework with named owners, targets, and a weekly reporting cadence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside product to create pricing structure for new product / add-ons&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver a revised deal desk process with documented pricing guardrails and approval workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First 6 Months&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
