&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HumanSignal&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Real-world data is the competitive edge in AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HumanSignal is a human data partner for companies building AI models and products. Our customers ship better AI, faster, because we partner with their researchers from real-world data creation to annotation to delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;We design and create datasets from scratch, recruit and manage the domain experts who evaluate model output, and run everything through our own platform, Label Studio, the open-source standard for data labeling and evaluation, used by over 1 million practitioners worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;We specialize in the operationally complex: real-world data collection, multimodal pipelines, and multi-step workflows. Advanced ML and AI teams use our enterprise platform to run their own data factories, and our services team to extend their reach where in-house capacity runs out.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you want to do work that materially shapes how the next generation of AI products gets built, we&#39;d love to talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Field Data Collection Specialist&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;HumanSignal is looking for Field Data Collection Specialists in the Columbus area to support a short-term, outdoor data collection project. You’ll travel to assigned locations, navigate a variety of outdoor environments, and use specialized equipment to collect high-quality field data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;This is an active, hands-on role that could be a great fit for hikers, outdoor enthusiasts, land surveyors, or anyone who enjoys spending significant time outdoors, navigating different locations, and working with technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to assigned data collection locations within approximately one hour of Columbus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use mobile devices and specialized equipment to collect field data according to defined project requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow detailed collection protocols to ensure data is captured accurately and consistently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate assigned locations and complete designated routes independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate progress, technical issues, and field challenges to the project team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete assigned work and project deliverables on schedule.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have reliable personal transportation and a valid driver’s license.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are technically savvy and comfortable learning new devices, applications, and equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can work independently, stay organized, and carefully follow detailed instructions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are dependable and comfortable navigating unfamiliar locations and environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with LiDAR, land surveying, GIS, mapping, or geospatial technology is a plus, but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience or a strong interest in hiking, outdoor recreation, location-based activities, or similar activities is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical &amp;amp; field requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;The following are essential functions of this field-based role and must be performed with or without reasonable accommodation:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stand and walk for extended periods throughout the workday.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Walk or hike up to approximately 5 miles at one time and up to approximately 10 miles over the course of a day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate uneven, unpaved, and rough outdoor terrain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry approximately 15–20 pounds of field equipment in a backpack for sustained periods while walking or hiking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work outdoors across varying terrain and typical seasonal weather conditions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;HumanSignal will consider reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities to enable them to perform the essential functions of the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-week contract&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approximately 40 hours/week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;$1,000–$1,200/week, depending on relevant experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Occasional evening and weekend availability required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Field-based work in Columbus and surrounding areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reliable personal transportation required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

